        "slc_71c85c172cd10fdcf6278d812bb43e199ca6cca67553ca2658144ce461865f8a"
      ],
      "text": "The project deliberately avoids configuration files; customization is done by asking Claude Code to modify the small codebase, or via a guided /customize command."
    },
