        "slc_c84ec2fcc5dbb59a47f31cedc3c7b50c93c09e674887c9ebadf67f016fccd5dd"
      ],
      "text": "A single Node host process routes messages through an entity model (user → messaging group → agent group → session), writes to the session's inbound.db, and wakes the container; the agent-runner inside polls inbound.db and writes responses to outbound.db."
    },
