        "slc_50e61219c429f01d31eca8043026e88e5f71a9227378c4c3a03c2f6fa13e809b",
        "slc_d3cd63c74c61e146b82a489436488aa6e7525de9dc10c7b5d89e4e0185fbca98"
      ],
      "text": "Each session has a pair of mounted SQLite files as the only host-container IO mechanism: inbound.db (host-written, container read-only) and outbound.db (container-written), each with exactly one writer and journal_mode=DELETE rather than WAL."
    },
