        "slc_e1ef3015efa3c75447101963c6c67a0e279cee9446949054b741aa43e7bd74cb"
      ],
      "text": "The host acts as orchestrator: it spawns containers on wakeUpAgent when none exists, kills idle containers after a timeout, and runs a ~60s sweep for stale detection, due-message wake, delivery, and recurrence insertion."
    },
