        "slc_c9690fff271f495297bcc8d40b2700adecc3b0243744dc1a0ac58fe923ce99c1"
      ],
      "text": "Channel adapters return platform channel and thread IDs without knowing agent-group or session IDs; the host maps those to the entity model, and session mode (shared vs per-thread) is configured per channel."
    },
