  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Agents run in their own Linux/Docker containers with filesystem isolation, so bash commands execute inside the container rather than on the host, and only explicitly mounted directories are visible. The project deliberately avoids configuration files; customization is done by asking Claude Code to modify the small codebase, or via a guided /customize command.",
